# Smoke test: open the control panel, move down the Looks list, Tab to Components, quit.
# Navigation only: no Enter, no font or Starship actions.
waittext Fusain 30000      # first paint (the first launch of a fresh exe can be slow: Defender)
idle 600 8000              # let the previews finish rendering
mark looks
key Down 3 300             # three presses, 300 ms apart
idle 400 4000
mark looks-after-3-down
key Tab
waittext Components 5000
idle 600 5000
mark components
key q
waitexit 5000
